	// LiveAnsweredCount How many of the live attempt's saved answers say something, by the rule the engine's navigator uses: a choice with an option picked, a true/false with a value, a text that is not blank, a fill-in with every blank filled. An answer that exists only in the browser's draft is not counted. Absent exactly when `hasLiveAttempt` is false.
